{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17551","headline":"和权载之离合诗 · 冯伉","name":"和权载之离合诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"车马退朝後，聿怀在文友。\n动词宗伯雄，重美良史功。\n亦曾吟鲍谢，二妙尤增价。\n雨霜鸿唳天，匝树鸟鸣夜。\n覃思各纵横，早擅希代名。\n息心欲焚砚，自腼陪羣英。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯伉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17551.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17551","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}